96407b57.600x338.jpg?t=1756475427"}],"short_description":"Brain School is chill card-based deduction game. A set of playing cards are shown face down: \ud83c\udccf\ud83c\udccf\ud83c\udccf\ud83c\udccf\ud83c\udccf Solve the code by asking questions such as &quot;What is the sum of the face cards?&quot; or &quot;Where are cards with the same value?&quot; and unlock new items that will help solve increasingly harder rounds.","steam_appid":3812620,"support_info":{"email":"us@sokpop.co","url":"sokpop.co"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}